description: Prevent Cursor co-author trailers in Git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git Commit Attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` to commit messages.
- Never add any other Cursor or AI-agent co-author trailer.
- When creating commits, attribute them only to the repository's configured Git user.
- Preserve co-author trailers explicitly supplied by the user for real human collaborators.
